nisms (Google and GitHub) but he does not use them.<br><br>I deleted the user from the invited list in my admin screen for the app and then added him again, generating a new invitation.<br><br>Same problem.<br><br>any advice?    <br><br>User using Firefox on Windows 7 Pro system.<br><br>thanks</span><u></u><u></u></p></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"color:#888888\">-- </span></span><span style=\"color:#888888\"><br><span>You received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;ShinyApps Users&quot; group.</span><br><span>To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">shinyapps-use...@googlegroups.com</a>.</span><br><span>To post to this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">shinyap...@googlegroups.com</a>.</span><br><span>To view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shinyapps-users/0ef84101-ccef-4b7c-afe3-e8cce861d87a%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shinyapps-users/0ef84101-ccef-4b7c-afe3-e8cce861d87a%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792362955615000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Z6v7tFb7K4bHr39Ovlvnc\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shinyapps-users/0ef84101-ccef-4b7c-afe3-e8cce861d87a%40googlegroups.com</a>.</span><br><span>For more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792362955615000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2N4_67PSUrW4n8n8VhpFJi\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.</span></span><u></u><u></u></p></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p></div></div></div>"
